-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 28th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Can be used to output a huge explosion, with a large range. Any dynamite sticks which blow up other explosives will have a chain reaction, and explosives can be used to chop trees or break ores.\"</big></i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Dynamite Stick x19</b> has a powerful explosion, and a large radius. Like any other explosive, it damages trees and ores.\n</p><p>Unlike bombs, dynamite blows up almost instantly in a chain reaction.\n</p><p>The Dynamite Stick x19 can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/Dugg%27s_Digging\" title=\"Dugg&#39;s Digging\">Dugg's Digging</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902030419\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 87/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.297      1 Template:Explosive\n100.00%   36.297      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3099-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902030419 and revision id 13657. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Items","Explosives","Interactive_Items"],"links":[{"title":"Dugg's Digging","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true}],"images":["19x_Dy